Usage: agent-deck uninstall [options]

Uninstall Agent Deck from your system.

Options:
  --dry-run           Show what would be removed without removing
  --keep-data         Keep XDG config/data/cache locations and legacy ~/.agent-deck/
  --keep-tmux-config  Keep tmux configuration
  -y                  Skip confirmation prompts

Examples:
  agent-deck uninstall              # Interactive uninstall
  agent-deck uninstall --dry-run    # Preview what would be removed
  agent-deck uninstall --keep-data  # Remove binary only, keep sessions
  agent-deck uninstall -y           # Uninstall without prompts
